    {
      "id": "C2",
      "claim": "La API pública puede traducir una clave con parámetro plural n.",
      "design_refs": [
        {
          "file": "DOCUMENTACION/87-Localizacion/plan-actual/03-Diseno.md",
          "line": 600,
          "text": "2. Código: `Localization.traducir_clave(\"ITEMS.SE_OFRECEN\", {}, n)` obtiene la forma correcta según el idioma activo. *(El ejemplo anterior usaba `tr(\"ITEMS.SE_OFRECEN\", \"\", n)`, que no es la API del módulo: corrección iter. 5. El módulo no traduce con `Object.tr()`.)*"
        }
      ],
      "evidence_refs": [
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 135,
          "text": "## Traduce `MODULO.SECCION.CLAVE` con params y opcional plural (n)."
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 136,
          "text": "func tr_key(module: String, section: String, key: String, params: Dictionary = {}, n: int = -1) -> String:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 137,
          "text": "var clave := (module + \".\" + section).to_upper()"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 138,
          "text": "if key != \"\":"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 139,
          "text": "clave += \".\" + key.to_upper()"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 140,
          "text": "return _tr_clave(clave, params, n)"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 157,
          "text": "## Traduce una clave COMPLETA (ej \"MAIN_MENU.PLAY\" o \"ITEMS.SE_OFRECEN\")."
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 158,
          "text": "## Expone la traducción de claves tal como viven en el catálogo .po, sin dividir."
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 159,
          "text": "func traducir_clave(clave: String, params: Dictionary = {}, n: int = -1) -> String:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 160,
          "text": "return _tr_clave(clave, params, n)"
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "corroborado_en_codigo_estatico",
      "notes": "tr_key y traducir_clave aceptan n y delegan a _tr_clave."
    },
    {
      "id": "C3",
      "claim": "La forma plural seleccionada respeta la regla declarada por el locale activo.",
      "design_refs": [
        {
          "file": "DOCUMENTACION/87-Localizacion/plan-actual/03-Diseno.md",
          "line": 600,
          "text": "2. Código: `Localization.traducir_clave(\"ITEMS.SE_OFRECEN\", {}, n)` obtiene la forma correcta según el idioma activo. *(El ejemplo anterior usaba `tr(\"ITEMS.SE_OFRECEN\", \"\", n)`, que no es la API del módulo: corrección iter. 5. El módulo no traduce con `Object.tr()`.)*"
        },
        {
          "file": "DOCUMENTACION/87-Localizacion/plan-actual/03-Diseno.md",
          "line": 601,
          "text": "- ⚠️ La forma se elige con `_indice_plural()`, que **hardcodea** la regla es/en; **no** lee `Plural-Forms` de la cabecera del `.po`. Ver `02-Analisis.md` §1.5."
        }
      ],
      "evidence_refs": [
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 357,
          "text": "## Índice plural para es/en/pt: 0 si n==1, 1 si no (nplurals=2)."
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 358,
          "text": "func _indice_plural(locale: String, n: int, nformas: int) -> int:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 359,
          "text": "if locale == \"es\" or locale == \"en\" or locale == \"pt\":"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 360,
          "text": "return 0 if n == 1 else mini(1, nformas - 1)"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 361,
          "text": "return 0"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/locales/pt.po",
          "line": 1,
          "text": "msgid \"\""
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/locales/pt.po",
          "line": 2,
          "text": "msgstr \"\""
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/locales/pt.po",
          "line": 3,
          "text": "\"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\\n\""
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/locales/pt.po",
          "line": 4,
          "text": "\"Language: pt\\n\""
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/locales/pt.po",
          "line": 5,
          "text": "\"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\\n\""
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "discrepancia_estatica_pt_n0",
      "notes": "pt.po declara plural=(n > 1), que ubica n=0 en índice 0; _indice_plural ubica todo n distinto de 1 en índice 1. Para PT n=0 los criterios no concuerdan. No se ejecutó runtime."
    },
    {
      "id": "C4",
      "claim": "El diseño incluye fallback de la forma plural portuguesa a español cuando falta la forma activa.",
      "design_refs": [
        {
          "file": "DOCUMENTACION/87-Localizacion/plan-actual/03-Diseno.md",
          "line": 601,
          "text": "- ⚠️ La forma se elige con `_indice_plural()`, que **hardcodea** la regla es/en; **no** lee `Plural-Forms` de la cabecera del `.po`. Ver `02-Analisis.md` §1.5."
        }
      ],
      "evidence_refs": [
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 163,
          "text": "func _buscar_texto(clave: String, n: int) -> String:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 164,
          "text": "# Plurales primero: las claves plural viven en _plural_forms, no en mensajes."
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 165,
          "text": "if n != -1:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 166,
          "text": "var plural_data = _plural_forms.get(_locale_actual, {})"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 167,
          "text": "if plural_data.has(clave):"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 168,
          "text": "var formas: Array = plural_data[clave]"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 169,
          "text": "var idx := _indice_plural(_locale_actual, n, formas.size())"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 170,
          "text": "if idx < formas.size() and formas[idx] != \"\":"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 171,
          "text": "return str(formas[idx])"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 172,
          "text": "# Fallback de plural a español si falta en el idioma activo"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 173,
          "text": "if _locale_actual != LOCALE_DEFECTO:"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 174,
          "text": "var plural_es = _plural_forms.get(LOCALE_DEFECTO, {})"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 175,
          "text": "if plural_es.has(clave):"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 176,
          "text": "var formas_es: Array = plural_es[clave]"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 177,
          "text": "var idx_es := _indice_plural(LOCALE_DEFECTO, n, formas_es.size())"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 178,
          "text": "if idx_es < formas_es.size() and formas_es[idx_es] != \"\":"
        },
        {
          "file": "game/isla-ancestral/scripts/localization/localization_manager.gd",
          "line": 179,
          "text": "return str(formas_es[idx_es])"
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "corroborado_en_codigo_estatico_con_limite",
      "notes": "El fallback existe; el índice de fallback también se calcula por _indice_plural y comparte la regla genérica n==1, aunque el catálogo es usa n!=1. No se valida aquí cómo tratar cantidades 0 en el catálogo fallback."
    },
